PETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"C","stem":"score=4 ga set [score] to (10) qo‘llansa, yakuniy qiymat nima?\n\n```text\nset [score] to (4)\nset [score] to (10)\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-02-015","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["-3","3","10","17"],"correct":1,"why":"6+4−7=3.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"C","stem":"ball dastlab 6, change ball by 4 so‘ng change ball by -7 bo‘lsa, yakuniy qiymat qanday?\n\n```text\nset [ball] to (6)\nchange [ball] by (4)\nchange [ball] by (-7)\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-02-016","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["Show variable","For this sprite only","For all sprites","Make a list"],"correct":1,"why":"For this sprite only mahalliy qamrov.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"C","stem":"Spraytga xos score o‘zgaruvchisi qaysi holatda boshqa spraytdan bevosita ko‘rinmaydi?\n\n```text\nmake a variable: score\nFor this sprite only\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-02-017","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["Yo‘q, o‘chadi","Doim 0 bo‘ladi","Ha, saqlanadi","Ro‘yxatga aylanadi"],"correct":2,"why":"hide variable monitorni yashiradi.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"C","stem":"O‘zgaruvchining ekrandagi ko‘rsatkichi berkitilsa, uning qiymati saqlanadimi?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (6)\nhide variable [a]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-02-018","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["8","3","5","15"],"correct":0,"why":"3+5=8.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"C","stem":"a=3 va b=5 bo‘lsa, set [a] to ((a)+(b)) natijasi nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (3)\nset [b] to (5)\nset [a] to ((a)+(b))\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-02-019","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["18","22","11","15"],"correct":0,"why":"a=11; b=7+11=18.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"a=4,b=7. Avval a ga b qo‘shildi, keyin b ga yangi a qo‘shildi. Yakuniy b nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (4)\nset [b] to (7)\nchange [a] by (b)\nchange [b] by (a)\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-020","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["7","8","9","10"],"correct":2,"why":"1+4×2=9.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"x=1 dan boshlanib 4 marta x ga 2 qo‘shildi. Natija qaysi?\n\n```text\nset [x] to (1)\nrepeat (4) [change [x] by (2)]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-021","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["16","8","32","6"],"correct":0,"why":"2→4→8→16.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"a=2, har aylanishda a ikki baravar qilinadi. 3 aylanishdan keyin a nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (2)\nrepeat (3) [set [a] to ((a)*(2))]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-022","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["15","25","20","10"],"correct":2,"why":"5×2×2=20.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"score=5; ikki marta score ni 2 ga ko‘paytiruvchi set bloki ishladi. Oxirgi score qanday?\n\n```text\nset [score] to (5)\nrepeat (2) [set [score] to ((score)*(2))]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-023","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["9","3","6","27"],"correct":0,"why":"Avval n=3; keyin 3²=9.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"n=0; sikl 3 marta n ni 1 ga oshiradi. So‘ng n n×n ga tenglanadi. Natija nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [n] to (0)\nrepeat (3) [change [n] by (1)]\nset [n] to ((n)*(n))\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-024","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["10","2","1","11"],"correct":0,"why":"y tayinlangan paytda x=10; keyingi x o‘zgarishi y ga ta’sir qilmaydi.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"D","stem":"x=10, y=2. set y to x bajarilib, keyin x=1 qilindi. Yakuniy y nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [x] to (10)\nset [y] to (2)\nset [y] to (x)\nset [x] to (1)\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-02-025","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["12","10","9","7"],"correct":1,"why":"Qo‘shiluvchilar 2+3+4; 1+9=10.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"E","stem":"a=1,b=2; 3 marta avval a ga b qo‘shiladi, keyin b 1 ga oshadi. Yakuniy a nechaga teng?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (1)\nset [b] to (2)\nrepeat (3) [\n  change [a] by (b)\n  change [b] by (1)\n]\n```","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-02-026","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["12","4","6","10"],"correct":3,"why":"1+2+3+4=10.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"E","stem":"i=1, s=0. To‘rt aylanishda s ga joriy i qo‘shilib, so‘ng i+1 bo‘lsa, yig‘indi nima?\n\n```text\nset [i] to (1)\nset [s] to (0)\nrepeat (4) [\n change [s] by (i)\n change [i] by (1)\n]\n```","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-02-027","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["0, 2, 5, 7","0, 2, 4, 5","0, 1, 3, 5","0, 2, 4, 6"],"correct":3,"why":"5 ga teng bo‘lishi shart emas; 0,2,4,6 da shart tugaydi.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"E","stem":"score o‘zgaruvchisi 0 dan 5 gacha har safar +2 bo‘lsa, qaysi qiymatlar ketma-ketligi olinadi?\n\n```text\nset [score] to (0)\nrepeat until <(score) > (5)> [\n change [score] by (2)\n]\n```","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-02-028","ch":2,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["(2,5)","(5,2)","(3,2)","(5,3)"],"correct":1,"why":"a=5; b=5−3=2.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"E","stem":"a=2,b=3. Birinchi a=a+b; keyin b=a−b. Yakuniy (a,b) qaysi?\n\n```text\nset [a] to (2)\nset [b] to (3)\nset [a] to ((a)+(b))\nset [b] to ((a)-(b))\n```","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-02-029","ch":2,"fmt":"Y2","opts":["1–b, 2–c, 3–a","1–c, 2–b, 3–a","1–b, 2–a, 3–c","1–a, 2–b, 3–c"],"correct":0,"why":"set tayinlaydi, change qo‘shadi, hide monitorni yashiradi.","src":"ICT6-2021 PDF 5–9; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; CAM8 PDF 37–39","l":"E","stem":"Tushunchalarni tegishli vazifa yoki ta’rifga moslashtiring.","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty