6-2021 PDF 5–15; CAM8 PDF 10–31","l":"C","stem":"broadcast [boshlash] qanday vazifa bajaradi?\n\n```text\nbroadcast [boshlash]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-03-018","ch":3,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["Faqat 1 soniya o‘tganda","Tovush tugagandan keyin","Bayroq qayta bosilganda","Tovush boshlanishidan oldin"],"correct":1,"why":"until done navbatdagi blokni tovush oxirigacha kutdiradi.","src":"ICT5-2020 PDF 95–103; ICT6-2021 PDF 5–15; CAM8 PDF 10–31","l":"C","stem":"play sound [meow] until done bajarilganda keyingi blok qachon boshlanadi?\n\n```text\nplay sound [meow] until done\nnext costume\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":3},{"id":"SL2-03-019","ch":3,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["2","6","5","3"],"correct":2,"why":"3+2=5; xabar qabul qilinganda skript bajariladi.","src":"ICT5-2020 PDF 95–103; ICT6-2021 PDF 5–15; CAM8 PDF 10–31","l":"D","stem":"Bayroq skripti broadcast [A] yubordi. Xabarni qabul qiluvchi skript score ni 2 ga oshiradi. Dastlab score=3 bo‘lsa, oxirgi qiymat nima?\n\n```text\nwhen green flag clicked\nset [score] to (3)\nbroadcast [A] and wait\n---\nwhen I receive [A]\nchange [score] by (2)\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-03-020","ch":3,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["ko‘k rangli xabar","hech qachon xabar yo‘q","ikkala xabar birga","qizil rangli xabar"],"correct":0,"why":"Answer satri ko‘k qiymatiga teng.","src":"ICT5-2020 PDF 95–103; ICT6-2021 PDF 5–15; CAM8 PDF 10–31","l":"D","stem":"Skript foydalanuvchidan rang so‘radi. answer = [ko‘k] bo‘lsa, qaysi tarmoq ishlaydi?\n\n```text\nask [Rang?] and wait\nif <(answer) = [ko‘k]> then\n say [ko‘k tanlandi]\nelse\n say [boshqa rang]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-03-021","ch":3,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["(8,−15)","(15,8)","(23,0)","(15, −8)"],"correct":3,"why":"O‘ngga 15, pastga 8.","src":"ICT5-2020 PDF 95–103; ICT6-2021 PDF 5–15; CAM8 PDF 10–31","l":"D","stem":"Sprayt dastlab 90° yo‘nalgan, move 15, turn right 90, move 8. Qaysi nuqtaga keladi (0,0 dan)?\n\n```text\ngo to x:(0) y:(0)\npoint in