ga qaytadimi?\n\n```text\nPD\nREPEAT 3 [FD 20 RT 120]\n```\n\n![poly3 chizma konturi](/scratch-logo-v2/poly3.svg)\n\n*Chizma sxematik, masshtab shartli.*","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-06-021","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["(15,20)","(20, 15)","(20,−15)","(−20,15)"],"correct":1,"why":"O‘ngga 20 va yuqoriga 15.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"D","stem":"Dastlab yuqoriga qaragan toshbaqa RT 90, FD 20, LT 90, FD 15 bajaradi. Yakuniy nuqta qaysi?\n\n```text\nRT 90\nFD 20\nLT 90\nFD 15\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-06-022","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["60°","72°","36°","45°"],"correct":3,"why":"360/8=45°.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"D","stem":"Muntazam sakkizburchak uchun REPEAT 8 ichida RT burchagi qancha bo‘ladi?\n\n```text\nREPEAT 8 [FD 10 RT ?]\n```\n\n![poly8 chizma konturi](/scratch-logo-v2/poly8.svg)\n\n*Chizma sxematik, masshtab shartli.*","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-06-023","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["8","2","16","4"],"correct":0,"why":"Tashqi sikl 2, ichki 4; 2×4=8.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"D","stem":"REPEAT 2 [REPEAT 4 [FD 10 RT 90] RT 180] skriptida jami FD buyruqlari necha marta?\n\n```text\nREPEAT 2 [\n REPEAT 4 [FD 10 RT 90]\n RT 180\n]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-06-024","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["80 yuradi, 80 iz","20 yuradi, 80 iz","80 yuradi, iz yo‘q","0 yuradi, iz yo‘q"],"correct":2,"why":"PU harakatni to‘xtatmaydi; faqat chizmaydi.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"D","stem":"Qalam ko‘tarilib turgan toshbaqa REPEAT 4 [FD 20 RT 90] bajaradi. Jami yurilgan masofa va iz qanday?\n\n```text\nPU\nREPEAT 4 [FD 20 RT 90]\n```","cog":"qollash","difficulty":4},{"id":"SL2-06-025","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["Beshburchak","Kvadrat","Uchburchak","Oltiburchak"],"correct":2,"why":"Tashqi burilish 120°, uch tomon.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"E","stem":"Rasmli shakl: REPEAT 3 [FD 25 RT 120] natijasida qaysi yopiq kontur paydo bo‘ladi?\n\n```text\nPD\nREPEAT 3 [FD 25 RT 120]\n```\n\n![poly3 chizma konturi](/scratch-logo-v2/poly3.svg)\n\n*Chizma sxematik, masshtab shartli.*","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-06-026","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["12 ta FD, kvadrat","12 ta FD, uchburchak","4 ta FD, olti burchak","7 ta FD, kvadrat"],"correct":0,"why":"Ichki sikl 4×3=12; kvadrat 3 marta boshlang‘ich nuqtadan chiziladi.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"E","stem":"REPEAT 3 [REPEAT 4 [FD 20 RT 90] RT 120] nechta FD bajaradi va qanday asosiy shakl takrorlanadi?\n\n```text\nPD\nREPEAT 3 [\n REPEAT 4 [FD 20 RT 90]\n RT 120\n]\n```\n\n![logo_rosette chizma konturi](/scratch-logo-v2/logo_rosette.svg)\n\n*Chizma sxematik, masshtab shartli.*","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-06-027","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["(20,10)","(40,20)","(0,0)","(−20,−10)"],"correct":2,"why":"Yuqori 20, o‘ngga10, pastga20, chapga10; yopiq to‘rtburchak.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"E","stem":"Toshbaqa dastlab yuqoriga qaraydi. REPEAT 2 [FD 20 RT 90 FD 10 RT 90] dan so‘ng yakuniy nuqta qaysi?\n\n```text\nPD\nREPEAT 2 [FD 20 RT 90 FD 10 RT 90]\n```\n\n![rect chizma konturi](/scratch-logo-v2/rect.svg)\n\n*Chizma sxematik, masshtab shartli.*","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-06-028","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","opts":["85","37","55","48"],"correct":2,"why":"Kvadrat 48 va oxirgi 7; izsiz 30 chiqariladi.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi","l":"E","stem":"Qalam tushirilgan: REPEAT 4 [FD 12 RT 90], PU FD 30, PD FD 7. Jami chizilgan iz uzunligi qancha?\n\n```text\nPD\nREPEAT 4 [FD 12 RT 90]\nPU FD 30\nPD FD 7\n```","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5},{"id":"SL2-06-029","ch":6,"fmt":"Y2","opts":["1–a, 2–c, 3–b","1–c, 2–b, 3–a","1–b, 2–c, 3–a","1–b, 2–a, 3–c"],"correct":2,"why":"FD oldinga, LT chapga, PD qalamni tushiradi.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi; SPETS-2026 PDF 3","l":"E","stem":"Tushunchalarni tegishli vazifa yoki ta’rifga moslashtiring.","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5,"native":{"left":["FD","LT","PD"],"right":["qalamni tushirish","oldinga yurish","chapga burilish"],"mapping":[1,2,0]}},{"id":"SL2-06-030","ch":6,"fmt":"Y3","opts":["1 → 3 → 2","3 → 1 → 2","3 → 2 → 1","2 → 1 → 3"],"correct":2,"why":"Avval PD, kvadrat, keyin PU bilan siljish.","src":"ATT-2026-04-13 PDF 4; SPETS-2026 PDF 4; klassik LOGO modelidagi o‘quv sintezi; SPETS-2026 PDF 3","l":"E","stem":"Berilgan buyruqlarni vazifaga mos bajarilish ketma-ketligida tartiblang. LOGOda kvadrat va undan keyin izsiz siljish:","cog":"mulohaza","difficulty":5,"native":{"steps":["PU FD 40","REPEAT 4 [FD 20 RT 90]","PD"],"order":[2,1,0]}}]'::jsonb) loop
   if exists(select 1 from public.questions where source_reference='scratch-logo-v2:'||(x->>'id')) then continue; end if;
   select c.id into v_construct from public.constructs c where c.code=(case (x->>'ch')::int
     when 1 then 'S4.BLOCK.01' when 2 then 'S4.BLOCK.01' when 3 then 'S4.BLOCK.02'
     when 4 then 'S4.BLOCK.03' when 5 then 'S4.BLOCK.04' else 'S4.BLOCK.05' end) and c.is_active;
   select id into v_lesson from public.lessons where module_id=v_module and slug=(case (x->>'ch')::int
     when 1 then 'scratch-logo-v2-01-sahna-koordinatalar'
     when 2 then 'scratch-logo-v2-02-ozgaruvchilar'
     when 3 then 'scratch-logo-v2-03-bloklar-hodisalar'
     when 4 then 'scratch-logo-v2-04-shart-sikllar'
     when 5 then 'scratch-logo-v2-05-pen-protsedura'
     else 'scratch-logo-v2-06-toshbaqa-grafika' end);
   if v_construct is null or v_lesson is null then raise exception 'TASK-203: mapping missing for %',x->>'id'; end if;
   v_q:=gen_random_uuid();
   insert into public.questions(id,subject_id,construct_id,group_code,format,cognitive,difficulty,stem_md,assets,is_generated,status,source_reference,source_lesson_id)
   values(v_q,v_subject,v_construct,'S4.BLOCK',(x->>'fmt')::public.question_format,(x->>'cog')::public.cognitive_level,
     (x->>'difficulty')::int,x->>'stem','[]'::jsonb,true,'draft'::public.content_status,
     'scratch-logo-v2:'||(x->>'id'),v_lesson);
   if x->>'fmt'='Y1' then
     v_opt_ids:=array[]::uuid[];
     for v_i in 0..3 loop
       v_opt:=gen_random_uuid();v_opt_ids:=array_append(v_opt_ids,v_opt);
       insert into public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md)
       values(v_opt,v_q,'a',v_i,x->'opts'->>v_i);
     end loop;
     insert into public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md)
     values(v_q,jsonb_build_object('correct_option_id',v_opt_ids[(x->>'correct')::int+1]),x->>'why');
   elsif x->>'fmt'='Y2' then
     v_left_ids:=array[]::uuid[];v_right_ids:=array[]::uuid[];
     for v_i in 0..2 loop
       v_opt:=gen_random_uuid();v_left_ids:=array_append(v_left_ids,v_opt);
       insert into public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md)
       values(v_opt,v_q,'a',v_i+1,x->'native'->'left'->>v_i);
     end loop;
     for v_i in 0..2 loop
       v_opt:=gen_random_uuid();v_right_ids:=array_append(v_right_ids,v_opt);
       insert into public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md)
       values(v_opt,v_q,'a',v_i+4,x->'native'->'right'->>v_i);
     end loop;
     v_pair_map:='{}'::jsonb;
     for v_i in 0..2 loop
       v_idx:=(x->'native'->'mapping'->>v_i)::int+1;
       v_pair_map:=v_pair_map||jsonb_build_object(v_left_ids[v_i+1]::text,v_right_ids[v_idx]::text);
     end loop;
     insert into public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md)
     values(v_q,jsonb_build_object('pairs',v_pair_map),x->>'why');
   else
     v_opt_ids:=array[]::uuid[];
     for v_i in 0..2 loop
       v_opt:=gen_random_uuid();v_opt_ids:=array_append(v_opt_ids,v_opt);
       insert into public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md)
       values(v_opt,v_q,'a',v_i+1,x->'native'->'steps'->>v_i);
     end loop;
     v_order_ids:=array[]::uuid[];
     for v_i in 0..2 loop
       v_idx:=(x->'native'->'order'->>v_i)::int+1;
       v_order_ids:=array_append(v_order_ids,v_opt_ids[v_idx]);
     end loop;
     insert into public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md)
     values(v_q,jsonb_build_object('order',to_jsonb(v_order_ids)),x->>'why');
   end if;
 end loop;
end
